.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt SOX 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm sox
.Nd convert and process audio files
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar global-options
.Op Ar input-options
.Ar input
.Op Ar output-options
.Ar output
.Op Ar effect Op Ar arguments ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads audio, applies effects, and writes the result.
This system builds sox_ng with static musl, built-in WAV and OSS support,
and FLAC through libFLAC; it has no other external codec library and no
FFmpeg decoder.
It reads FLAC of 8, 16, 24 or 32 bits a sample and writes 8, 16 or 24.
Use
.Xr play 1
and
.Xr rec 1
for the default OSS sound device, or
.Xr soxi 1
to inspect a file.
.Pp
Options before a file name apply to that file.
Effects follow the output file name, in the order they should run.
A file name of
.Sq -
uses standard input or output.
.Fl n
selects a null input or output, useful with the
.Cm synth
and
.Cm stat
effects.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl r Ar rate
Set the sample rate in Hz.
On an input, this describes raw data; on an output, it resamples.
.It Fl c Ar channels
Set the number of channels.
.It Fl b Ar bits
Set the number of bits per sample.
.It Fl e Ar encoding
Set the encoding, such as
.Cm signed-integer
or
.Cm unsigned-integer .
.It Fl t Ar type
Set the format explicitly, such as
.Cm wav , flac , raw
or
.Cm oss .
.It Fl S
Show progress and a live level meter on standard error.
.It Fl q
Suppress progress.
.It Fl Fl clobber , Fl Fl no-clobber
Allow replacement of an output file, or prompt first.
.It Fl Fl help
List options, effects, formats and audio drivers in this build.
.It Fl Fl help-effect Ar name
Describe an effect.
.It Fl Fl help-format Ar name
Describe a format.
.It Fl Fl version
Print the version.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh EXAMPLES
Convert a WAV to mono at 44100 Hz:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sox stereo.wav -r 44100 mono.wav channels 1
.Ed
.Pp
Compress a WAV to FLAC, and decode it again:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sox take.wav take.flac
sox take.flac back.wav
.Ed
.Pp
Keep the first five seconds at half volume:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sox input.wav output.wav trim 0 5 vol 0.5
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mixer 1 ,
.Xr play 1 ,
.Xr rec 1 ,
.Xr soxi 1 ,
.Xr dsp 4
.Sh LIMITS
External MP3, Ogg Vorbis and Opus codecs are disabled, and so is Ogg FLAC;
plain FLAC is available.
Use the GNU root's
.Xr ffmpeg 1
for those formats.
